# Ableton Hub - Planned Features Roadmap

This document contains detailed implementation plans for future features.

**Last Updated**: August 22, 2026 (v1.0.11)

---

## ✅ Recently Completed (v1.0.11)

### Live 13, Analytics & Smart Launcher

#### Live 13 & Alpha Version Support ✅
- **Status**: Complete
- **Implementation**: Shared version parsing/sorting for Live 13+ and pre-release builds (alpha, beta, RC, e.g. `12.4a1`); used for badges, install detection, and launch matching
- **Features**:
  - Detect Live 13+ and pre-release folder/exe names
  - Sort pre-releases before the matching release build
  - Configurable scan of default vs extended install locations in Settings
- **Files**: `src/utils/live_version.py`, `src/services/live_detector.py`, `src/database/models.py`, `src/config.py`, `src/ui/dialogs/settings_dialog.py`, `tests/test_live_version.py`, `tests/test_live_detector.py`

#### Plugin Usage Dashboard ✅
- **Status**: Complete (Phase 5.1)
- **Implementation**: Aggregates plugin frequency from indexed projects; table UI in sidebar / Tools menu
- **Features**:
  - Unique-plugin count and projects-with-plugin-data summary
  - Searchable table sorted by usage
  - Show Projects (opens first matching project) and Filter Library by plugin
- **Not in this release** (deferred): bar charts, plugin-combination matrix, missing-plugin warnings, dedicated `PluginUsage` table
- **Files**: `src/services/plugin_analytics.py`, `src/ui/widgets/plugin_dashboard_view.py`, `src/ui/main_window.py`, `src/ui/managers/view_manager.py`, `src/ui/managers/menu_bar_manager.py`, `src/ui/widgets/sidebar.py`

#### ML Cluster Visualization ✅
- **Status**: Complete (Phase 5.3)
- **Implementation**: Background K-means clustering of indexed feature vectors; tree view of clusters and projects
- **Features**:
  - Configurable cluster count (2–20)
  - Cluster labels with avg tempo and common plugins (`ClusterInfo` contract)
  - Double-click project to open properties
  - Create collection from cluster
- **Not in this release** (deferred): 2D PCA scatter plot, DBSCAN/Hierarchical algorithm picker
- **Files**: `src/ui/widgets/cluster_view.py`, `src/ui/workers/cluster_worker.py`, `src/services/ml_clustering.py`

#### Open With... Smart Launcher ✅
- **Status**: Complete
- **Implementation**: Project context menu opens a dialog to pick which Live install launches the project
- **Features**: Version mismatch warnings; optional backup before opening in a newer Live; recommended install highlighted
- **Files**: `src/ui/dialogs/open_with_live_dialog.py`, `src/ui/widgets/project_grid.py`, `src/ui/main_window.py`

