## ✅ Recently Completed (v1.0.3–v1.0.10)

### Release Infrastructure & UX

#### Startup Soundcheck ✅
- **Status**: Complete
- **Implementation**: Plays audio on launch to verify output; configurable via Settings
- **Features**: Custom sound file support; 440 Hz sine fallback if no file found; fade-in/fade-out
- **Files**: `src/services/soundcheck_service.py`, `src/config.py`, `src/ui/dialogs/settings_dialog.py`

#### Automatic Update Checker ✅
- **Status**: Complete
- **Implementation**: Queries GitHub releases API on startup (3s delay); configurable via `check_for_updates_at_startup`
- **Features**: UpdateDialog with platform-specific download link; Help menu entry
- **Files**: `src/services/update_checker.py`, `src/ui/dialogs/update_dialog.py`

#### FTUE First-Launch Dialog ✅
- **Status**: Complete
- **Implementation**: Renders `FTUE.md` as HTML for new users
- **Files**: `src/ui/dialogs/ftue_dialog.py`

#### Song Name Generator ✅
- **Status**: Complete
- **Implementation**: Service and dialog for generating random creative project names
- **Files**: `src/services/song_name_generator.py`, `src/ui/dialogs/song_name_generator_dialog.py`

#### Select Exports Dialog ✅
- **Status**: Complete
- **Implementation**: Two-column UI (DB exports + filesystem browse) for manually linking audio exports to projects
- **Files**: `src/ui/dialogs/select_exports_dialog.py`

