## Technical Considerations

### Performance
- Lazy loading for large dashboards
- Background calculation for analytics
- Caching of computed metrics
- Virtual scrolling for large lists

### Database
- ✅ Composite indexes added for common query patterns (Phase 1 & 2)
- ✅ SQLite WAL mode and cache optimizations implemented
- Consider materialized views for complex stats (future optimization)
- Periodic cleanup of stale cache data

### Testing
- Unit tests for calculation logic
- Integration tests for database queries
- UI tests for dashboard interactions

